features.spec:
Parse OC_comments with json.loads into a list of comment strings. Missing/unparseable input -> null. Empty list -> 0. Otherwise return 1 if any comment matches (re.IGNORECASE) the regex r"[^,;.!?
]+[,;]\s+[^,;.!?
]+[,;]\s+(?:and|&)\s+[^,;.!?
]+" (three items within one sentence/line separated by comma or semicolon, with 'and' before the last item), else 0. Purely mechanical matching on raw current text: no semantic filtering, quotations inside comments are not excluded, and the pattern may match non-list clauses (e.g., 'However, I think, and ...'). Do not read title, argument or conversation.
